wb-echo (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: base docker-compose.yml with wb.* labels installed to
    /usr/lib/wb-docker-app/echo/; thin postinst/prerm calling into
    wb-docker-app. Second-service isolation proof (issue #7) — reuses the
    shared helper with no duplicated lifecycle logic.
  * Ship etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52wb-echo-no-unattended to exclude wb-echo from
    unattended-upgrades (design §3.11/§3.11.1, issue #5): the helper's
    end-anchored blacklist does not match wb-echo, so the service package
    carries its own drop-in per convention.

 -- Wiren Board Team <info@wirenboard.com>  Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
